# <type>(<scope>): <subject>
# |<-- Type: feat|fix|docs|refactor|test|chore|build|perf|revert
# |  |<- Scope: cli|core|api|auth|http|skill|research|spec|task
# |  |  |<-- Subject: imperative mood, lowercase, ≤ 72 chars, no trailing period
#
# Body: explain WHY, not what. Record decisions a future reader can't recover from the diff.
#       - What constraint or API fact forced this shape
#       - What alternatives were rejected and why
#       - What this deliberately does NOT do
#
# Footer:
# BREAKING CHANGE: <description>
#
# Wrap body at 100 columns. Blank line above body, blank line above footer.
